    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dace029145d5a40655bb9bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "似乎也有人将其称之为……原初的感情哦？\n……希望您也能好好享受这份余韵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "048861714b6f32d4c64d9ad314a76e8646df25660362d0bdc421b1da7fc99c7f",
