      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37e8ecf07cf3efecb27d61bd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要补充糖分啊，用棒棒糖！\n毕竟一直都在严格限制饮食……我要吃5根！",
      "source_fingerprint": "143833495c4548ecf2567cb47d7634879c4644881e461cbbf33c8c8a83fc4a98",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1434"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10abc8dda48d354a5caec8c5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊！？　其他人怎样都无所谓啦！\n我才是最值得关注的！　少看不起人了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a4b46297ce37fcb5f406133ea3f5c326f6147082e736554150dd496400ffd22",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1435"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26da495a8e782ae25eb705fb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没关系好吧！　话说，避开人多的时候来啊！\n让在家里好好看直播的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "458d2748deb2d06303e9f2be80f4a0022319dc1eeadd0f76afca8c3159d5c9a9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1436"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae0d5369bdc42b3035ad668c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那家伙，老是戳\n我的痛处！　总有一天要双倍奉还给她！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf059bf2d9a538c71f2926fe0dd39d9d5949f17da01bdec16877fdacf16b4849",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1437"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f4aadf36406d86543e2fc83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为什么非要回答这种问题啊！\n除了开心以外还能有啥啊混蛋！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9862452a0355935d2b80e6bac556aeadac8a361224e5219c7579c893d678c4fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1438"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c69354bfaed23b3cf84e3fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没关系好吧！　话说，避开人多的时候来啊！\n让在家里好好看直播的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "458d2748deb2d06303e9f2be80f4a0022319dc1eeadd0f76afca8c3159d5c9a9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1439"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26af55ec8499b3480fa8a4fc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唔！？是、是的……曾经用飞踢把\\n刚贴上和纸的拉门给……踢破了一个洞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a6893cdd98f89fe07fb2203285fc77aef86f4895c64f54c8003c87591e6bf20",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "144"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f883bbc579ceb940b38e3c4d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那家伙，老是戳\n我的痛处！　总有一天要双倍奉还给她！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf059bf2d9a538c71f2926fe0dd39d9d5949f17da01bdec16877fdacf16b4849",
