    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:474c7050f14c4836f9b550d0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为什么非要回答这种问题啊！\n除了开心以外还能有啥啊混蛋！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9862452a0355935d2b80e6bac556aeadac8a361224e5219c7579c893d678c4fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1441"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6541052e788b85ae4e36f4a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你们这些家伙，喊得那么起劲！\n……下次也要全力为我欢呼啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "970b75b4e624e0e7e4819b0932a206323a1cf029a652cedfb6fe550e57dbface",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1442"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:758e2de16d2e7c29b408cafb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喂，明天开始也要拿出气势来啊！？\n我们的实力，还不止这种程度吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "559ca43b5f0e1750c31d005b1421a2b11996fdd6f2fcdc08f9127668945a2254",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1443"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3638229d032e6da4ecce9691",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你们这些家伙，喊得那么起劲！\n……下次也要全力为我欢呼啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "970b75b4e624e0e7e4819b0932a206323a1cf029a652cedfb6fe550e57dbface",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
