    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbb02b3acbc517a238fa78bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这个词用在我身上，还名不副实。\n……要称得上是『职人』，还差得远。",
      "source_fingerprint": "806256b3e14452707a3aa88a82bfb440e378d3e7c29e594ef663a92dbda1f4e2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1446"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7785cba92c2ba4ca7b4d15c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无论被拖入怎样的速度战还是末脚战\n都要坚持到底——我是抱着这样的觉悟去挑战的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89d56c028fdb997247a0511b15006c074d8dd1a8fa1c3d225e5fa4715d66e15c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1447"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20b14f26f282a0ef9700fb22",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "室友虽然说要为我庆祝……\n但我拒绝了。我想如果能夺冠，到时候再庆祝——。",
      "source_fingerprint": "662c5cad9b868b42565fe8ab0a38e995c7ebfcc0765072e12760f33a552f8351",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1448"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7534b80d250121c7d591db8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "给祖父和祖母。虽然有跑时差，但他们说\n会起床看我的赛事的……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "105203394b21187d490030e82ca1f265b6aae9f1fe8ee6d236d6857f5da3c824",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1449"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4186bfeeb521107683a92357",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "和训练员，开会商讨。\n下一场——也就是决赛，是工作的最后阶段了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5efd1a2b48e2f553536b04146ec4a050543a9ca82320fa7b334104c9a2ce4d17",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1450"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba20ba34c27eac3f94488a93",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "室友虽然说要为我庆祝……\n但我拒绝了。我想如果能夺冠，到时候再庆祝——。",
      "source_fingerprint": "662c5cad9b868b42565fe8ab0a38e995c7ebfcc0765072e12760f33a552f8351",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1451"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cce86cda348bf51f726ae7d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "给祖父和祖母。虽然有跑时差，但他们说\n会起床看我的赛事的……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "105203394b21187d490030e82ca1f265b6aae9f1fe8ee6d236d6857f5da3c824",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
