      "source_text": "我在看工作人员。看着他们工作时\\n手脚利落的模样，让我很感兴趣呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2282de700dd03d1d0c415d6942b75d80aaba1b34345d850840e83683d4083bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
