    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:562e6b0a7bfc07635fe4e092",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，无可奉告。\n就算不特意传达，也应该看到了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df7885500dc6c1f0204eb4de5455b859fd9f8a26c5fd459870251e940edbf25e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1482"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a9d28fbe90ec5c302fb0c83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哦呀，你这样评价吗。那么下一场比赛……\n说不定会发生更让人惊叹的事呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e4af114c57c29100fd1215446c52b9983e6a60399fd80932d5fcf7c532935bb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1483"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f7feaba0309c0dfb1a707a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "首先，好好品味今天的胜利吧。\n和那边的训练员一起，吃到肚子饱饱的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a5f9b0ccadf3d65f6119692e74fcc5dcbce7dbcdcd6bedee59d558bc64fc72e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1484"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ddf269b85078e8b5837d9a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嘛，熟人还挺多的……呀，\n小超常，小梦。来，过来这边。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d75b1708c077e43fe137fe1d3b3e163185cbf4121dfa3da2fea7b6fe06107b27",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1485"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb9b1b3a86d96890cfb073a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我也是！　这种赛事还是“第一次”！\n既新鲜又有趣，简直要让人上瘾了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2316b40b931586d62171674fb2360817ea056ae6d4157a73be01762ad816446",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
