      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34c4bd7e81f3efe87c922e84",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『觉醒』，之类的吧！\n借着这势如破竹的胜利，一路冲向高潮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e1006a3ffc0fd7e226232e1c2ad82bc90ce180d07e31e9f485c2ecc11ef0c51",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1494"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebc0aac1880497e6228a4b83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的，简直就像魔鬼编辑一样！　但是——\n正是多亏了那些充满热情的挑刺，我才能赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bb40e0754b8c770aa422b0fe91ba7cb2f1759bebb0ad9d6bb81c675b4508d82",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1495"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1b34a0606c432b7514b6724",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大赛中伏兵和大型新人的活跃可是定番——\n我是打算作为打破常规的主角去迎战的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d75d662afefee27d6fd45294fd1839191ee4491e6c12e2984a352d51c2f9a466",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1496"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce8cc4e1d7a184a0e4a80c0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是因为和小杏她们一起修行过了呢。\n可不能让对手看到丢脸的一面啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0b3b4c803ef33a83188af1b5ba95472e8e1c1697ca50ea3a8b74f070446478e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1497"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32d2f9de6a527ec019cf404a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "妈妈给我送来了我最爱吃的炖菜。\n力量满满，胜利已是板上钉钉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cf749c7c0a9ed60c353c23fdc028f65c4d9b78ca7f03f66d84804189a89cf03",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1498"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0d60f8abe7eed9839c405a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大赛中伏兵和大型新人的活跃可是定番——\n我是打算作为打破常规的主角去迎战的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d75d662afefee27d6fd45294fd1839191ee4491e6c12e2984a352d51c2f9a466",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
